@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor #FAF6EB
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica
skinparam defaultFontColor #291B1D
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #BA3143
skinparam activityBackgroundColor white
skinparam activityBorderColor #BA3143
skinparam activityDiamondBackgroundColor #D8F24B
skinparam activityDiamondBorderColor #291B1D
skinparam classBackgroundColor white
skinparam classBorderColor #BA3143
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam sequenceParticipantBackgroundColor white
skinparam sequenceParticipantBorderColor #BA3143
skinparam sequenceLifeLineBorderColor #291B1D
skinparam sequenceGroupBackgroundColor white
skinparam sequenceGroupBorderColor #BA3143
skinparam rectangleBackgroundColor white
skinparam rectangleBorderColor #BA3143
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFFDF6
skinparam noteBorderColor #BA3143
title Marathon Wrapped — business process
|Event organizer|
start
:Prepare sample event and categories\nSoekarno Run 2027 — 5K and 10K;
:Create or update demo runners,\nresults, splits and optional data;
|Marathon Wrapped|
:Validate BIB uniqueness and linked records;
while (Save rejected?) is (yes)
  :Explain rejection\nAllow correction;
  |Event organizer|
  :Correct demonstration data;
  |Marathon Wrapped|
  :Validate corrected data;
endwhile (no)
:Persist demonstration data\nConfirm successful save;
|Event organizer|
:Review event results and demo readiness;
|Runner|
:Select a runner / BIB;
|Marathon Wrapped|
if (Usable result available?) then (yes)
  :Provide accurate baseline recap\nShow known DNF without finish values;
else (no)
  :Explain result unavailable\nOffer retry or runner selection;
  stop
endif
|Runner|
if (Want additional Strava detail?) then (yes)
  :Choose connection and authorization;
  |Strava service|
  :Return authorization outcome\nand available metrics or failure;
  |Marathon Wrapped|
  :Include available authorized metrics\nRetain baseline when unavailable;
else (no)
endif
|Marathon Wrapped|
:Present matched photos or no-photo state;
|Runner|
:Review personal race recap;
if (Want a saved / shareable image?) then (yes)
  |Marathon Wrapped|
  :Attempt image export;
  if (Export succeeds?) then (yes)
    |Runner|
    :Save image; optionally share it;
  else (no)
    |Marathon Wrapped|
    :Show error and recovery action\nPreserve recap and results;
  endif
else (no)
endif
|Runner|
stop
legend bottom
Business process expressed as a UML activity with responsibility lanes;
not a BPMN 2.0 conformance claim. FR-01–FR-18, NFR-09.
Timing and photo collection are simulated. No registration or payment workflow.
Organizer preparation precedes runner use; no organizer approval per recap.
endlegend
@enduml
